# Figma design reference

The portfolio UI is specified in the Figma file `portfoli-`.

- File key: `OSen2tDZ1GECecQVY2KG21`
- Source page: `mockup` (`9:64`)
- URL: https://www.figma.com/design/OSen2tDZ1GECecQVY2KG21/portfoli-?node-id=9-64&m=dev

